F2017%2F04%2Ftopnews%2Fchina-cas-1-4-million-cambricon-chips%2F&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ACambricon+Technologies" class="Z3988" about="#mwt16" id="mwuw"></span></span></li>
